---
<BlogPostLayout
  title="Nadi Shodhana: Alternate Nostril Breathing Step by Step | Sankalp"
  description="Learn Nadi Shodhana (alternate nostril breathing / anulom vilom) step by step: how to do it, its benefits for stress and sleep, and the science behind this calming pranayama."
  path="/blog/nadi-shodhana-alternate-nostril-breathing.html"
  headline="Nadi Shodhana: Alternate Nostril Breathing Step by Step"
  publishDate="2026-06-08"
  tag="Pranayama + Modern Science"
  heroTitle="Nadi Shodhana &mdash; Alternate Nostril Breathing, Step by Step"
  heroSub="One of the oldest and gentlest breathing techniques in yoga. Five minutes is enough to quieten a busy mind &mdash; here is exactly how to do it."
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(howToJsonLd)} />
